{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skelly Screamer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Skelly Screamer, use your <strong>microphone to move</strong>! The <strong>louder you scream, the faster you move</strong>! Overcome a vertical obstacle course to reach your destination in space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, you can use your keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W\u0337\u035d\u0329h\u0335\u0306\u0356a\u0337\u0307\u033bt\u0335\u0350\u0353 \u0334\u0341\u0328a\u0338\u0304\u0323m\u0334\u0300\u031e \u0337\u034a\u034dI\u0334\u0346\u0339?\u0338\u0304\u0321</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scream Meter</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/40238d88d275dfda5eb7250921b565df.poster.avif?t=1766081963\" width=420 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/40238d88d275dfda5eb7250921b565df.webm?t=1766081963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/40238d88d275dfda5eb7250921b565df.mp4?t=1766081963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>louder</strong> you scream, the<strong> faster</strong>\u00a0Skelly runs. So<strong> keep your cool</strong>!\u00a0<strong>Skelly Screamer</strong> is a rage game, but If you <strong>vocally express your rage</strong>, you might cause a <strong>devastating fall</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the<strong> Skelly Screamer Demo,</strong>\u00a0try out the <strong>first\u00a0</strong>level of the full game! But you probably won't make it past the first anyway...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skelly</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are<strong> Skelly</strong>. This morning you rose from the dead too late and missed your alarm clock! It's time you get up and <strong>begin your trek to work</strong>... <strong>IN SPACE</strong>! Better start climbing!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/31c947cf616a50364b46d7bfd8282a02.poster.avif?t=1766081963\" width=420 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/31c947cf616a50364b46d7bfd8282a02.webm?t=1766081963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/31c947cf616a50364b46d7bfd8282a02.mp4?t=1766081963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skelly Screamer </strong>has an array of unique levels ranging from <strong>sci-fi cities, to\u00a0e\u0336\u035d\u031dx\u0336\u0302\u0316i\u0335\u0302\u0331s\u0335\u0340\u0330t\u0337\u0305\u035ae\u0338\u0346\u0330n\u0337\u0342\u031dt\u0335\u030a\u033bi\u0335\u030c\u0359a\u0337\u0313\u0355l\u0337\u0314\u0333 \u0338\u0312\u0330d\u0336\u0312\u0354r\u0334\u031b\u0333e\u0335\u031b\u0330a\u0338\u0303\u033bd\u0337\u0302\u0330, to the old west</strong>! <strong>Scream</strong> through each one of them to reach your workplace in\u00a0<strong>space</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Obstacles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The<strong> Skelly Screamer Demo</strong> includes an assortment of bizarre obstacles. These obstacles include, an <strong>angry knight</strong> with a <strong>grudge</strong>, <strong>fiery barriers</strong>,\u00a0<strong>conveyer belts,\u00a0</strong> <strong>y\u0338\u033f\u0317o\u0337\u0302\u031fu\u0334\u0341\u0333r\u0334\u0346\u0319 \u0337\u0350\u0326l\u0335\u0306\u033aa\u0335\u0344\u033cc\u0335\u031a\u0349k\u0334\u033f\u0353 \u0338\u033d\u0359o\u0337\u0357\u031ff\u0338\u0301\u0355 \u0337\u0300\u031ff\u0338\u0315\u032er\u0334\u030a\u0333e\u0338\u0309\u033be\u0334\u0344\u0329 \u0337\u0357\u0333w\u0335\u0350\u032ai\u0334\u0344\u0356l\u0337\u0305\u032al\u0338\u0302\u0329</strong>, and <strong>more</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Without A Microphone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though <strong>Skelly Screamer</strong> is <strong>meant</strong> to be played with a <strong>microphone</strong>, you may <strong>use standard keyboard controls</strong> in the alternative\u00a0<strong>Keyboard Mode</strong><i>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W\u0334\u035b\u0345h\u0334\u0306\u033be\u0338\u033e\u0320r\u0338\u035d\u0323e\u0338\u0360\u0319 \u0334\u0357\u0333d\u0338\u0343\u0316i\u0335\u033e\u033bd\u0338\u0344\u0354 \u0336\u0343\u0320I\u0336\u0340\u0324 \u0334\u031a\u0325c\u0335\u0305\u034eo\u0338\u035d\u0331m\u0336\u0307\u0320e\u0335\u0360\u035c \u0336\u0357\u0325f\u0335\u0311\u0320r\u0338\u0309\u0326o\u0335\u0307\u0325m\u0338\u0314\u034e?\u0338\u0308\u0348</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >/watch?v=IMNjS_Wr584</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Money and Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/6271daa065d8915510c311bcd026b389.poster.avif?t=1766081963\" width=420 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/6271daa065d8915510c311bcd026b389.webm?t=1766081963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/6271daa065d8915510c311bcd026b389.mp4?t=1766081963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>money</strong> that can be used to buy <strong>upgrades</strong> between levels!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Normal Mode:</strong> Use your microphone to move and conquer the height!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drunk Mode:</strong>\u00a0Not only do you move faster the louder you scream, but you also move in a left-to-right sine wave motion that increases in amplitude the louder you scream! </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3103630?t=1766081963","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/af75b50f1a03f405dc9bc58eab6a241722105623/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766081963","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/f1d3f58d03616b22eb04b1642340c01162e759a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766081963","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/f1d3f58d03616b22eb04b1642340c01162e759a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766081963","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3835860,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skelly Screamer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Skelly Screamer, use your <strong>microphone to move</strong>! The <strong>louder you scream, the faster you move</strong>! Overcome a vertical obstacle course to reach your destination in space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, you can use your keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W\u0337\u035d\u0329h\u0335\u0306\u0356a\u0337\u0307\u033bt\u0335\u0350\u0353 \u0334\u0341\u0328a\u0338\u0304\u0323m\u0334\u0300\u031e \u0337\u034a\u034dI\u0334\u0346\u0339?\u0338\u0304\u0321</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scream Meter</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/40238d88d275dfda5eb7250921b565df.po